  "solution": "Chọn hệ trục tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math> như hình vẽ dưới đây.\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/0fb7d3ff76710aa2c9b6fcb682759768088e6a9b67562d13d777a0af4eb95ea4.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tKhi đó elip có trục lớn là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và trục nhỏ là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Như thế phương trình chính tắc của elip là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>144</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Giả sử <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thì từ hình vẽ ta suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> thuộc elip nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>144</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>144</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Suy ra hình chữ nhật <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy diện tích phần trồng hoa là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>125</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>.",
